{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>The tinshemet.</b> It is the קלב\"א ש\"וריץ, and it resembles a mouse that flies at night. And the tinshemet mentioned among the creeping things resembles it and has no eyes, and they call it טלפ\"א."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {0 "The la'az קלב\"א ש\"וריץ is Old French 'chauve-souris' (bat); טלפ\"א is Old French 'taupe' (mole)."}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:05:51.386269361Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}